      en: ["The nature reserve was established in 1965.", "It occupies a total area of 58800 hectares.", "The reserve is situated in the Sukhbaatar province.", "It was created to protect the regional red deer population.", "The terrain is characterized by a forest-steppe ecosystem.", "Cervus elaphus is the primary species protected here."],
