      en: ["The park was officially established and opened in 1969.", "Located in central Ulaanbaatar, south of Sukhbaatar Square.", "Features an iconic artificial lake with a white castle.", "The Ferris wheel provides 360-degree views of the capital.", "Home to more than 20 diverse rides and entertainment facilities.", "Central hub for celebrations on International Children's Day."],
      es: ["Año de apertura: 2004.", "Superficie: 30 hectáreas.", "Número de atracciones: 25.", "Altura de la noria: 40 metros.", "Visitantes anuales: 300.000.", "Precio de la entrada: 10.000 MNT."],
